## Departments

wof-department-crown = The Crown
wof-department-crown-description = Rule the kingdom, set its priorities and keep the other departments working together.
wof-department-royal-guard = Royal Guard
wof-department-royal-guard-description = Protect the queen and her subjects, investigate crimes and keep the peace.
wof-department-stores = Royal Stores
wof-department-stores-description = Grow, hunt and cook the food the kingdom runs on.
wof-department-healers = Healers
wof-department-healers-description = Treat the sick and injured, from scrapes to broken wings.
wof-department-trade = Trade Guild
wof-department-trade-description = Buy, sell and move goods in and out of the kingdom.
wof-department-citizens = Citizens
wof-department-citizens-description = Live in the kingdom and help wherever you're needed.

