## Job descriptions

wof-job-description-queen = Rule the kingdom. Set priorities, settle disputes, and keep your throne.
wof-job-description-royal-advisor = Speak for the queen, handle diplomacy and keep the court's business moving.
wof-job-description-captain-of-the-guard = Lead the Royal Guard. Protect the queen and keep order in the kingdom.
wof-job-description-royal-guard = Patrol the kingdom, make arrests and defend its citizens.
wof-job-description-master-of-stores = Run the food stores. Make sure the farmers, hunters and cooks keep the kingdom fed.
wof-job-description-farmer = Grow fruit and crops for the royal kitchen.
wof-job-description-hunter = Hunt and fish in the wilds and bring meat back to the kitchen.
wof-job-description-royal-cook = Turn the kingdom's harvest into meals.
wof-job-description-chief-healer = Run the healers' house and handle the hardest cases yourself.
wof-job-description-healer = Treat injuries, poisonings and broken wings.
wof-job-description-merchant = Trade goods with citizens and travellers, and keep the market stocked.
wof-job-description-citizen = Live your life in the kingdom. Lend a claw where it's needed.

